<title>USA: Omaha hogs off $0.25 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs off $0.25 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.25</p>
<p>lower. Top $58.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-260 lbs    58.25-58.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-280 lbs    57.25-58.00</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. Steady to 1.00 higher. Top 56.00</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-450 lbs    50.00-50.50</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    51.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-700 lbs    54.00-56.00</p>
